{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42747","headline":"秋夕书怀呈戎州郎中 二 · 刘兼","name":"秋夕书怀呈戎州郎中 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风送秋荷满鼻香，竹声敲玉近虚廊。\n梦回故国情方黯，月过疎帘夜正凉。\n菱镜也知移艳态，锦书其奈隔年光。\n鸾胶处处难寻觅，断尽相思寸寸肠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}